-- docs/adr/0001-workspace-contract.md --
# ADR-0001: Workspace Contract

* **Status**: Accepted
* **Date**: 2026-10-21

<!-- semedit-adr-metadata:v1 keys=summary,description,role,scope,area,languages; do not change key names or order. -->
| Key | Value |
| :--- | :--- |
| summary | Keep edits inside the selected workspace boundary. |
| description | Requests resolve within the selected workspace and do not leak machine-local paths. |
| role | invariant |
| scope | project |
| area | backend |
| languages | go, rust |

## Context

The workspace determines which source files a semantic request may inspect or edit.

## Decision

Resolve all request paths relative to the selected workspace root.

## Invariants

* Search results use workspace-relative paths.

## Consequences

Agents can open a result without learning the host user's absolute filesystem path.
